  ('m','The Tripartite Struggle was over','Kannauj','Delhi','Kanchipuram','Three powers fought for it.'),
  ('m','Brahmagupta was a','mathematician and astronomer','king','poet only','He made remarkable achievements.'),
  ('m','Society in this period was mostly','rural and agrarian','urban only','nomadic','Farming was the main work.'),
  ('t','Inscriptions were sometimes written in two languages.',True,'To reach both elite and local readers.'),
